OL,3,GNEWSAM6 motorway shut after van fire
OL,4,Aand diesel spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M6 motorway was shut in the West
OL,7,FMidlands after a van fire and
OL,8,F"significant diesel spillage" caused
OL,9,Fsignificant delays, National Highways
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FAll three lanes were closed for more
OL,13,Fthan two hours on the southbound side
OL,14,Fof the carriageway between junction six
OL,15,Ffor Gravelly Hill Interchange, known as
OL,16,FSpaghetti Junction, and junction five
OL,17,Fnear Castle Bromwich from 16:00 GMT on
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
