OL,3,GNEWSAM6 motorway shut after van fire
OL,4,Aand diesel spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services attended on the
OL,7,Fscene with contractors to assess the
OL,8,Froad surface and recover the vehicle
OL,9,Fbefore two lanes were reopened at about
OL,10,F18:30.
OL,12,FMotorists have been advised to follow
OL,13,Fdiversion routes via the A45127
OL,14,Fsouthbound and A47 eastbound, to join
OL,15,Fthe motorway after junction five.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
